  "body": "The domintro section currently lists the properties only; it doesn't list the constructor or methods.\r\n\r\nAlso, the way the properties are listed is a bit strange; it makes them look like static properties: `URLPattern.protocol`. Instead they should look like instance properties: <code><var>urlPattern</var>.protocol</code>.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/whatwg/meta/issues/190, or probably just skip to https://github.com/whatwg/meta/issues/190#issuecomment-799601600 for my summary of best practices that we're trying to converge the ecosystem on a bit.",
